[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688510789","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103357#issuecomment-2688510789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103357","id":2688510789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gP2tF","user":{"login":"Zylann","id":1311555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTE1NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1311555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann","html_url":"https://github.com/Zylann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T16:38:44Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T16:41:39Z","body":"Workaround tip: I had to duplicate materials/shadermaterials a lot at runtime in my project, and found too that while `duplicate` is easy, it is far from optimal (notably due to the use of `get_property_list` and generic get/set usage internally). So instead I create a material manually and copy around relevant properties using the most direct APIs possible (properties, StringNames...). I also pool them to avoid re-creation. This is usually faster but requires more work. I haven't investigated Standard materials though, maybe there is another bottleneck here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688510789/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688740252","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103357#issuecomment-2688740252","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103357","id":2688740252,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gQuuc","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T18:15:09Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T18:15:09Z","body":"Looks like most of the time is in string operations in `_validate_property()`\n\n_Most of the remaining time is in the `_validate_property()` for the parent classes (GeometryInstance, Node3D, etc.)_\n<img width=\"725\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b889446-7478-4644-9e0d-40e16fb6e683\" />\n\nI thought that `_validate_property()` isn't run on export, but it appears it is used in both export builds and in editor builds :/ ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688740252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688992958","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103357#issuecomment-2688992958","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103357","id":2688992958,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gRsa-","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T20:02:01Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T20:02:08Z","body":"There's no reason to run `_validate_property()` in non-editor builds (or release builds at least), so we should make it a no-op.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688992958/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2689106351","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103357#issuecomment-2689106351","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103357","id":2689106351,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gSIGv","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T21:03:15Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T21:03:15Z","body":"_validate_property is also used in AudioSteamPlayer, which seems to exhibit very similar performance problems, though further testing is required for this one...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2689106351/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2689123665","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103357#issuecomment-2689123665","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103357","id":2689123665,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gSMVR","user":{"login":"Zylann","id":1311555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTE1NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1311555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann","html_url":"https://github.com/Zylann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T21:13:05Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T21:34:16Z","body":"`_validate_property` is documented as a way to alter existing properties (usually their flags), notably properties that were inherited (and therefore can't be changed otherwise). This means it can be used for things that are also not editor-specific. And even when games/tools use `get_property_list` (or indirectly, for example when saving objects), not running this method would end up in different behavior.\nIn my case, when making a custom procedural Cubemap class, I had to use it in order to prevent the `_images` property (inherited from TextureLayered) from being saved when the resource is saved, because like NoiseTexture, my texture is procedural and therefore this specific property shouldnt have the STORAGE flag.\nI feel like this method ended up been more powerful than what it was added for? Because if it's supposed to be editor-only that's quite a big difference from what possibilities the documentation shows.\nPersonally I think there could be more efficient ways to do things (a bunch of use cases could simply modify flags once in the class data instead of having to check every property every time comparing strings etc; unless there is another way to do that I'm not aware of?)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2689123665/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2965973954","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103357#issuecomment-2965973954","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103357","id":2965973954,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wySvC","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T10:02:32Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T10:02:32Z","body":"Fixed (or at least mitigated) by #105907. Please let us know if the performance is still problematic and needs further profiling in 4.5 beta 1 or later.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2965973954/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]